Description: GTK4 Wi-Fi hotspot toggle with a command-line interface
 Turn a create_ap Wi-Fi hotspot on and off from a GTK4/libadwaita window or
 from the terminal (hotspot-toggle enable|disable|toggle|status|info).
 Includes a live view of connected devices and traffic, QR-code sharing, and
 a root helper that supervises create_ap as a systemd unit. create_ap is
 bundled privately, so it does not clash with a system-wide copy.
